      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your despair over the fallen lineage and the end of your oath is a heavy burden to carry in the ruins. I can sense the weight you feel as a ghost in a world that no longer glories in the past you once championed. I hope you find some peace in the silence and begin to build a new path that feels like it belongs to you.",
